Naceri 公开了 Windows CLFS 漏洞 SignDrop 的 PoC，可诱导 Windows Defender 等特权进程创建认证文件并借此获取 SYSTEM 权限。","source",{"_54":176,"_177":178},"publishedAt","selected",true,"BleepingComputer","firstParty",false,"vg18mgfk9qqhb8fj6zco29xou","SignDrop PoC 利用 Windows CLFS 认证机制实现 SYSTEM 权限提升","研究者 MSNightmare 公开 SignDrop PoC，利用 Windows Common Log File System 驱动创建 .cnpf 伴生文件时的路径重定向，使标准用户获得可写的 SYSTEM 文件并可链式启动 SYSTEM shell。",{"_54":184,"_177":178},"2026-11-12T17:50:27.000Z","The Hacker News","n4537m9mjolx4pmk97c6i9782","Nightmare Eclipse 发布 Windows 本地提权零日漏洞 SignDrop 利用代码","安全研究员 Abdelhamid Naceri 以 Nightmare Eclipse 名义发布 Windows 零日漏洞 SignDrop 的 PoC，利用 CLFS 处理 .cnpf 签名文件时的缺陷，使本地普通用户将权限提升至 System，并借助 Windows Defender 打开攻击者指定路径下的日志文件。",{"_54":190,"_177":178},"2026-11-13T08:50:36.000Z","SecurityWeek","jhu91zby7hqlwmaqvjr45zrcl","Windows 零日漏洞 SignDrop 可利用 CLFS 认证缓解机制的阶段性部署缺陷，诱使 Windows Defender 以 SYSTEM 权限创建认证文件，使本地攻击者实现权限提升，并可能绕过其他安全产品的自我防御或防篡改机制。",{"_54":194,"_177":178},"Security Affairs",{"_197":203,"_13":204,"_20":183,"_17":162,"_200":205},{"_197":198,"_13":199,"_20":21,"_17":128,"_200":201},"factId","fkkOn4gdRkiA","公开 SignDrop Windows 零日利用","representative",{"_167":185,"_13":186,"_28":187,"_171":202,"_173":189,"_174":175},{"_54":190,"_177":178},"fzX64zbdUKtw","公开SignDrop本地提权利用代码",{"_167":179,"_13":180,"_28":181,"_171":206,"_173":183,"_174":175},{"_54":184,"_177":178},"participants48h","newParticipants6h",0,"recentReports24h","observationComplete","rank",{"_214":215,"_216":-5},"changelogVersion","2026-10-01T08:00","release"]
